  "body_html": "<h1>Knapsack Relaxations And Dynamic Programming</h1>\n<p>The algorithmic knapsack layer connects the fractional relaxation,\ndynamic-programming optimum, and integral greedy rule.</p>\n<p>The Lean interface includes feasibility and optimality of the dynamic program,\nand a half-approximation guarantee comparing the integral greedy rule to the\ndynamic-programming optimum.</p>",
